  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CCF Contingent Loan - COVID-19 Coverage</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Prstamo Contingente CCF - Cobertura COVID-19</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo general del proyecto es contribuir afortalecer la respuesta inmediata de salud pblica del pas a la emergenciaCOVID-19. El objetivo especfico correspondiente a la cobertura COVID-19 es incrementar la disponibilidad y eficiencia de financiamiento del pas para cubrir gastos pblicos extraordinarios relacionados a la emergencia sanitaria.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The general objective of the project is to help strengthen the country&apos;s immediate public health response to the COVID-19 emergency. The specific objective corresponding to the COVID-19 coverage is to increase the availability and efficiency of financing in the country to cover extraordinary public expenditures related to the health emergency.</narrative>
  </description>
